{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 5,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 287.989,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after we had come down into the wilderness unto our father,",
      "verse": "5:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.103,
      "end": 7.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he was filled with joy,",
      "verse": "5:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.512,
      "end": 10.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also my mother, Sariah, was exceedingly glad,",
      "verse": "5:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.85,
      "end": 13.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for she truly had mourned because of us.",
      "verse": "5:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.898,
      "end": 17.427,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For she had supposed that we had perished in the wilderness;",
      "verse": "5:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.607,
      "end": 20.44,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and she also had complained against my father,",
      "verse": "5:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 20.62,
      "end": 24.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "telling him that he was a visionary man; saying:",
      "verse": "5:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.515,
      "end": 28.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold thou hast led us forth from the land of our inheritance,",
      "verse": "5:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.014,
      "end": 30.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my sons are no more,",
      "verse": "5:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 30.866,
      "end": 32.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we perish in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "5:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 33.589,
      "end": 35.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner of language",
      "verse": "5:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 35.952,
      "end": 38.506,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "had my mother complained against my father.",
      "verse": "5:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 39.186,
      "end": 42.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it had come to pass that my father spake unto her, saying:",
      "verse": "5:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 42.895,
      "end": 45.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I know that I am a visionary man;",
      "verse": "5:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 45.397,
      "end": 48.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for if I had not seen the things of God in a vision",
      "verse": "5:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 48.828,
      "end": 51.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I should not have known the goodness of God,",
      "verse": "5:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 51.748,
      "end": 54.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but had tarried at Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "5:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 54.204,
      "end": 56.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had perished with my brethren.",
      "verse": "5:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 57.485,
      "end": 60.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I have obtained a land of promise,",
      "verse": "5:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 60.637,
      "end": 62.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which things I do rejoice;",
      "verse": "5:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 63.093,
      "end": 68.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I know that the Lord will deliver my sons out of the hands of Laban,",
      "verse": "5:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 68.381,
      "end": 72.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bring them down again unto us in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "5:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 72.73,
      "end": 74.913,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner of language",
      "verse": "5:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 75.093,
      "end": 78.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did my father, Lehi, comfort my mother, Sariah, concerning us,",
      "verse": "5:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 79.128,
      "end": 83.493,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "while we journeyed in the wilderness up to the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "5:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 83.673,
      "end": 86.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to obtain the record of the Jews.",
      "verse": "5:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 89.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when we had returned to the tent of my father,",
      "verse": "5:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 90.106,
      "end": 92.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold their joy was full,",
      "verse": "5:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 92.283,
      "end": 94.28,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my mother was comforted.",
      "verse": "5:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 94.96,
      "end": 96.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And she spake, saying:",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 96.719,
      "end": 98.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I know of a surety",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 98.849,
      "end": 102.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord hath commanded my husband to flee into the wilderness;",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 102.976,
      "end": 105.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and I also know of a surety",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 105.85,
      "end": 108.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord hath protected my sons,",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 108.445,
      "end": 111.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and delivered them out of the hands of Laban,",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 111.829,
      "end": 115.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and given them power whereby they could accomplish the thing",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 115.306,
      "end": 117.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which the Lord hath commanded them.",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 117.576,
      "end": 120.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner of language did she speak.",
      "verse": "5:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 121.46,
      "end": 124.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they did rejoice exceedingly,",
      "verse": "5:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 124.844,
      "end": 128.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did offer sacrifice and burnt offerings unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "5:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 128.786,
      "end": 131.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they gave thanks unto the God of Israel.",
      "verse": "5:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 132.02,
      "end": 135.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they had given thanks unto the God of Israel,",
      "verse": "5:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 135.869,
      "end": 141.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "my father, Lehi, took the records which were engraven upon the plates of brass,",
      "verse": "5:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 141.343,
      "end": 143.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did search them from the beginning.",
      "verse": "5:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 144.577,
      "end": 148.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he beheld that they did contain the five books of Moses,",
      "verse": "5:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 148.658,
      "end": 151.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which gave an account of the creation of the world,",
      "verse": "5:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 152.042,
      "end": 153.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also of Adam and Eve,",
      "verse": "5:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 154.126,
      "end": 155.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were our first parents;",
      "verse": "5:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 156.664,
      "end": 159.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also a record of the Jews from the beginning,",
      "verse": "5:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 160.141,
      "end": 163.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even down to the commencement of the reign of Zedekiah,",
      "verse": "5:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 163.618,
      "end": 165.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "king of Judah;",
      "verse": "5:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 165.738,
      "end": 169.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also the prophecies of the holy prophets, from the beginning,",
      "verse": "5:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 169.773,
      "end": 173.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even down to the commencement of the reign of Zedekiah;",
      "verse": "5:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 173.575,
      "end": 175.479,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also many prophecies",
      "verse": "5:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 175.659,
      "end": 178.492,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which have been spoken by the mouth of Jeremiah.",
      "verse": "5:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 179.172,
      "end": 186.602,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that my father, Lehi, also found upon the plates of brass a genealogy of his fathers;",
      "verse": "5:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 186.782,
      "end": 190.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore he knew that he was a descendant of Joseph;",
      "verse": "5:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 190.77,
      "end": 193.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even that Joseph who was the son of Jacob,",
      "verse": "5:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 194.061,
      "end": 195.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who was sold into Egypt,",
      "verse": "5:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 196.145,
      "end": 199.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and who was preserved by the hand of the Lord,",
      "verse": "5:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 199.297,
      "end": 201.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might preserve his father, Jacob,",
      "verse": "5:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 201.892,
      "end": 204.586,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all his household from perishing with famine.",
      "verse": "5:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 205.266,
      "end": 208.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were also led out of captivity",
      "verse": "5:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 208.325,
      "end": 210.601,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and out of the land of Egypt,",
      "verse": "5:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 210.781,
      "end": 213.149,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "by that same God who had preserved them.",
      "verse": "5:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 213.829,
      "end": 218.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus my father, Lehi, did discover the genealogy of his fathers.",
      "verse": "5:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 219.117,
      "end": 221.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Laban also was a descendant of Joseph,",
      "verse": "5:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 222.176,
      "end": 225.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore he and his fathers had kept the records.",
      "verse": "5:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 226.339,
      "end": 228.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when my father saw all these things,",
      "verse": "5:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 228.98,
      "end": 230.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was filled with the Spirit,",
      "verse": "5:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 231.064,
      "end": 233.897,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to prophesy concerning his seed\u2014",
      "verse": "5:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 234.577,
      "end": 239.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "That these plates of brass should go forth unto all nations, kindreds, tongues,",
      "verse": "5:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 239.865,
      "end": 242.141,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and people who were of his seed.",
      "verse": "5:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 242.821,
      "end": 247.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he said that these plates of brass should never perish;",
      "verse": "5:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 247.273,
      "end": 250.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither should they be dimmed any more by time.",
      "verse": "5:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 250.239,
      "end": 253.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he prophesied many things concerning his seed.",
      "verse": "5:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 254.077,
      "end": 258.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that thus far I and my father had kept the commandments",
      "verse": "5:20",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 259.04,
      "end": 261.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherewith the Lord had commanded us.",
      "verse": "5:20",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 261.856,
      "end": 267.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we had obtained the records which the Lord had commanded us, and searched them",
      "verse": "5:21",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 267.377,
      "end": 272.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and found that they were desirable; yea, even of great worth unto us,",
      "verse": "5:21",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 272.758,
      "end": 277.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that we could preserve the commandments of the Lord unto our children.",
      "verse": "5:21",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 278.454,
      "end": 283.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, it was wisdom in the Lord that we should carry them with us,",
      "verse": "5:22",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 283.278,
      "end": 287.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as we journeyed in the wilderness towards the land of promise.",
      "verse": "5:22",
      "lineIndex": 86
    }
  ]
}